            <div xml:id="d1308">

                <pb facs="1033" n="957" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg957"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 311.523/20</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Spanish Ambassador to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Spanish Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-02-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 15, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary</hi>: Supplementing my note of the 3d
                    instant relative to the purpose of His Majesty’s Government to remove to Spain
                    the remains of the Spanish seamen buried in the Naval Cemetery at Seavey Island,
                    I have the honor to inform your excellency that I am told that the said seamen
                    were buried under numbers and that the names corresponding to every number are
                    recorded at the Navy Department of the United States. I should be much obliged
                    to your excellency if you would kindly procure for me a statement of the names
                    of the said seamen and also let me know whether it is necessary to get a special
                    permit from the Board of Health for the removal of each of the remains or
                    whether the general permit of the Navy Department will suffice.</p>
                <p>I avail [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Juan Riaño</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
